{"id":"n74361-4-9","stage":1,"title":"어머니 · 妈","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74361-4-9-1","ko":"어머니, 어머니에게는 이 옷이 더 잘 어울릴 것 같은데요?","zh":"妈妈，我觉得这件衣服您穿会更合适呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니에게는","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니에게는","audio":"/audio/91525a887f37fc446a98.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好看地，漂亮地","explanation":"잘：好看地，漂亮地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"10","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"어울릴","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어울릴","audio":"/audio/d39647b69df01151c4bf.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데요?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데요","audio":"/audio/441937d13341d37ec5fd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好看地，漂亮地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常帅气而美丽地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c91a5a765330fe1c93c6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74361-4-9-2","ko":"그래요? 그럼 한번 입어 볼게요.","zh":"是吗？那我就试穿一下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"可不是，就是，当然","explanation":"그럼：可不是，就是，当然","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"입어","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입어","audio":"/audio/adb17795588ce713306d.mp3"}},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼게요","audio":"/audio/2cd0ea99474da1b2d1a0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"可不是，就是，当然","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"62277","definition":"用于肯定回答，表示自不必说，没有疑问。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a9699d5e68569d53b4d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.32,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74361","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那我就试穿一下吧。","今天午饭吃什么呢？","妈妈，我觉得这件衣服您穿会更合适呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？那我就试穿一下吧。","妈妈，我觉得这件衣服您穿会更合适呢。","今天午饭吃什么呢？"],"answer":0}]}
